# Baby Talk Android release signing example
# 复制为 mobile/android/key.properties 后再填入真实值。
# 注意：profile demo 包不依赖此文件；release 构建在未配置时会显式失败。

# 相对 mobile/android/ 的 keystore 路径，例如：../secrets/baby-talk-demo-upload.jks
storeFile=../secrets/baby-talk-demo-upload.jks
storePassword=replace-me
keyAlias=baby-talk-upload
keyPassword=replace-me
